{"title":"2017 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(faster)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (faster)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e88337cb1c20b179200e89f8cb73436403ded6c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 &lt; 2^{n} &lt; 2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"114\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there aren't that many powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> that are greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/5617f6d8def6056c5921630439d64b56cfa519ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, we can simply list all of them:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/4/864c58078bf5c74aa7634e6138c27863cefa340d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\text{, }16\\text{, }32\\text{, }64\\text{, }128\\text{, }256\\text{, }512\\text{, }1024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"255\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>From this list, we see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81ca9c5c8715be868438500743202d6773d05bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28faster.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(faster)\">Solution 2 (faster)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (faster)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4f3ae887ebc147cf15b2ed474a142220ede61d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> is below <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ffbc99e2825b6f4458b370bae99157e55a79e65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> is above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/5617f6d8def6056c5921630439d64b56cfa519ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/2/642dea81077b775f66619c0b093d5e3ac52c9df7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> must be the smallest power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> matching the criteria.\n</p><p>We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/8/cf856775e3de1168a9a4f29bc68d3651d0bf6051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{10} = 1024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />, which is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/5617f6d8def6056c5921630439d64b56cfa519ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad6ef8bc8354f707cf4ec040d38c02dbaa9f88c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{11} = 2048$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" /> isn't, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3b2422eb1e019642032c00b0c5d5982903fe45d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" /> must be the largest power matching the criteria.\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (inclusive), so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/2/f02e15519cc23c05980ae4b9f00a01cc53d9b03e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 - 3 + 1 = \\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"127\" height=\"25\" /> possible values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018003516\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 101/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4266/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.915      1 2017_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.915      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35972:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018003516 and revision id 279543. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}